{title: Aaj Mai Upar Aasman Niche}
{artist: Kavita Krishnamurthy Kumar Sanu Jatin Lalit}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A],        Aaj mai upar aasman niche
[D] [A],        aaj mai aage jamana hai pichhe
[F#m] [D],        Tell me o khuda
[F#m] [D],        abb mai kya karu
[E] [A],        chalu sidhee kee ulatee chalu
[A],        Yunhi bin bat ke chalke jaye hansi
[B] [E],        Dole jab hawa lage gudugudee
[F#m] [D],        Sambhalu gir padu,
[F#m] [D],        arre arre tauba kya karu
[E] [A],        chalu sidhee kee ulatee chalu
[A],        Jhumeja mauj me rukna na janejan
[B] [E],        dekhu ye tarang rukati hai kaha
[F#m] [D],        Mai bhee ter sang
[F#m] [D],        inn lehron pe chalu,
[E] [A],        sar ke bal ya kadam se chalu
